WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.430
- Ella, congratulations on
the success of Dickinson.

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:06.810
You have a great American
accent in the show.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:07.800
Was that a lot of practice?

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.890
Was that hard?

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:12.550
- So one of my favorite
things to do as a child

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.780
was to, well, first off,

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.760
I was just obsessed with Legally Blonde

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:20.070
and really American culture as a whole.

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.320
And my favorite thing to do for my friends

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:24.230
or the thing I did to make them laugh

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:28.750
was to pretend I was an
American woman at a nail salon.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.830
So I'd be like, oh my
God, I just broke a nail.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.090
Do you, how do I fix it?

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.360
Do I get like, do I get the blush?

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:38.520
Do I get the rouge?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.076
Like, that was what I did for my friends.

00:00:41.076 --> 00:00:42.413
- I, first of all, I love.

00:00:42.413 --> 00:00:43.246
- Excellent, excellent.

00:00:43.246 --> 00:00:44.860
- I know, but I love that she said,

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.760
well, I was obsessed
with American culture.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:48.280
Like I loved Legally Blonde.

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.670
And I'm like, just so you know,

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.923
there's more to us than Legally Blonde.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:59.060
You've got to dive deeper,
Ella, you've got to dive deeper.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:00:59.893
- Yeah, go deep.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.070
- In nail salons or becoming lawyers.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.574
That was all you Americans did in my head.

00:01:04.574 --> 00:01:05.407
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:06.649
- That's my favorite!

